{
  "project_id": 22,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 10398,
  "title": "Every kid needs a champion",
  "author": "Rita F. Pierson",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/rita_pierson_every_kid_needs_a_champion",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T02:11:39.415746Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T02:11:39.415746Z",
  "lead_time": 71.057,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 135,
        "text": "I have spent my entire life either at the schoolhouse, on the way to the schoolhouse, or talking about what happens in the schoolhouse.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8860456134",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 136,
        "text": "(Laughter) Both my parents were educators, my maternal grandparents were educators, and for the past 40 years, I've done the same thing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ED0F5E52E7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 115,
        "text": "And so, needless to say, over those years I've had a chance to look at education reform from a lot of perspectives.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "14A87E6E73",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "Some of those reforms have been good.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC1D65856D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "Some of them have been not so good.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA37B8E06F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "And we know why kids drop out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8369359B78",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "We know why kids don't learn.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "680B23FF49",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "It's either poverty, low attendance, negative peer influences...",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7E10831D5A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 12,
        "text": "We know why.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8C7D5B239",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "But one of the things that we never discuss or we rarely discuss is the value and importance of human connection.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8B54D0FA14",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "Relationships.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6B88817A84",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "James Comer says that no significant learning can occur without a significant relationship.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "891A773D47",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "George Washington Carver says all learning is understanding relationships.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A7B455BFC1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "Everyone in this room has been affected by a teacher or an adult.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E288B251EC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "For years, I have watched people teach.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7C33D2750C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "I have looked at the best and I've looked at some of the worst.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B02626EBBC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "A colleague said to me one time, \"They don't pay me to like the kids.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FA3A21392F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "They pay me to teach a lesson.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0F67E83926",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "The kids should learn it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "746ACAF5C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "I should teach it, they should learn it, Case closed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ADFE22B75B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 22,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "You know, kids don't learn from people they don't like.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C58A4916B8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "(Laughter) (Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5F436D8B16",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "Well, your year is going to be long and arduous, dear.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF0A586B2F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "Needless to say, it was.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8D71280A12",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "Some people think that you can either have it in you to build a relationship, or you don't.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "424CE3D33C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "I think Stephen Covey had the right idea.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "353F9F783C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "He said you ought to just throw in a few simple things, like seeking first to understand, as opposed to being understood.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF2BF2CF86",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "Simple things, like apologizing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2869D9584",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "You ever thought about that?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "854B99AEA0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "Tell a kid you're sorry, they're in shock.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A0735D64E9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "I taught a lesson once on ratios.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "312EC6FE42",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "I'm not real good with math, but I was working on it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "43DFA063DC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "(Laughter) And I got back and looked at that teacher edition.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "94ED7599CF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "I'd taught the whole lesson wrong.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "31C14A8A86",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 14,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "I came back to class the next day and I said, \"Look, guys, I need to apologize.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F9E2D77898",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "I taught the whole lesson wrong.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6999D98CF3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "I'm so sorry.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2E044BD268",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "They said, \"That's okay, Ms.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5DC5617E9D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "Pierson.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AB0A7C8673",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "You were so excited, we just let you go.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2F8892AD52",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "I have had classes that were so low, so academically deficient, that I cried.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF5A8919B4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "I wondered, \"How am I going to take this group, in nine months, from where they are to where they need to be?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "605AD00CE4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "And it was difficult, it was awfully hard.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2BEB0D47C9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "How do I raise the self-esteem of a child and his academic achievement at the same time?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "39BFA59CCF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "One year I came up with a bright idea.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB26361F8F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 25,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "You were chosen",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F8A2E619D8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "the best teacher",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "31F3093E4B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 101,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "the best students",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B14DEBDC26",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 191,
        "text": "I told all my students, \"You were chosen to be in my class because I am the best teacher and you are the best students, they put us all together so we could show everybody else how to do it.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9FAF18FF54",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "One of the students said, \"Really?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EE6AD7B612",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9E753003EB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "so when we walk down the hall, people will notice us, so you can't make noise",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "431D213C59",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "We have to show the other classes how to do it, so when we walk down the hall, people will notice us, so you can't make noise.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7DB64C3B62",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "You just have to strut.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8C4B4A980A",
      "from_name": "label",
